  "description": "TOHYIB crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P b c a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H68 Co4 Ho8 N50 O50 2+,2(N1 O3 1-),10(H2 O1),8(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Co1 (Co) has 0 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 0 O neighbors; Ho1 (Ho) has 9 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 9 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Co3 (Co) has 0 O neighbors; Co4 (Co) has 0 O neighbors; Ho5 (Ho) has 9 O neighbors; Ho6 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho7 (Ho) has 9 O neighbors; Ho8 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 5 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.654-4.031 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.74-115.77°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ho(pyzic){Ho3Co2(pyzha)6(*pyzha)(NO3)2(H2O)(MeOH)2}]2·(NO3)2·nH2O·8MeOH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
